# Image preview

Entity images (logos, avatars, profile photos) must use **`ImagePreview`** from `@webonone/ui-kit`. When there is no image (`src={null}`), show the kit **first-upload empty state** (centered image icon on `bg-muted`) — never custom “No logo” / “No image” text boxes or hand-rolled muted squares.

Related: [ui-kit-consumption.mdc](ui-kit-consumption.mdc), [media-project.mdc](media-project.mdc), [dialog-windows.mdc](dialog-windows.mdc) (Media picker embed), [item-list skill](../skills/item-list/SKILL.md), [details-page-cards skill](../skills/details-page-cards/SKILL.md).

## Required

```tsx
import { ImagePreview } from '@webonone/ui-kit'

// Default preview (h-40 w-40) — profile / logo cards
<ImagePreview src={logoUrl} alt="Company logo" mode="view" />

// Missing image → kit empty state (do not branch on logoUrl for a custom placeholder)
<ImagePreview src={null} alt="Company logo" mode="view" />

// List row thumbnail
<ImagePreview src={item.logoUrl} alt={item.name} mode="view" className="h-10 w-10 rounded-md" />

// Editable (opens Media via consumer onEdit)
<ImagePreview src={url} alt={name} mode="edit" onEdit={openMediaPicker} />
```

| Concern | Rule |
|---------|------|
| Empty / first upload | `src={null}` — kit shows centered `Image` icon; **no** “No logo” text tiles |
| Has image | Pass URL in `src`; kit uses `object-cover` |
| List thumbs | Override size with `className` (e.g. `h-10 w-10 rounded-md`); empty icon scales with box |
| Profile / logo cards | Default `h-40 w-40`; `mode="edit"` + `onEdit` when user can change the image |
| Upload source | Media embed / platform media dialog — UI Kit does **not** host upload |

## Forbidden

- Custom empty placeholders (`No logo`, grey boxes with text, initials-only tiles) instead of `ImagePreview` when `src` is null
- Raw `<img>` + separate empty-state markup for logos/avatars that `ImagePreview` covers
- Embedding Media picker UI inside UI Kit

