## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root   # or identity-root / ui-kit-root
npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit        # when changing ImagePreview
```

Manual: open a company with no logo — list and logo card show the image-icon empty state, not “No logo” text.
